      {
        "id": "model-control-flow-purpose",
        "moduleId": "control-flow-overview",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "补充：控制流决定语句的执行顺序",
        "markdown": "control flow 描述的是一个程序「下一步执行哪条语句」。没有控制流时，语句只会按书写顺序从上到下执行；有了决策、循环与分支，执行顺序才能随条件与数据改变。\n\n因此阅读控制流代码时，关键问题不是语句写了什么，而是**在当前状态下会走哪条路径**。输入不同，走过的路径就可能不同。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-control-flow-taxonomy"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "textbook-decision-making",
        "moduleId": "decision-making",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "mechanism",
        "title": "教材：decision-making",
        "markdown": "decision-making 在这里主要指 `if (...) {...} else {...}` 结构：先求值括号中的条件，再根据结果选择执行 if 分支还是 else 分支。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-d998d2c477335adeea4bf2f2",
